  {
   "kop": "De goniometrische cirkel",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "figuur",
     "html": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 470 268\" width=\"470\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"460\" height=\"242\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e4ded0\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<line x1=\"107.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"363.0\" y2=\"128.0\" stroke=\"#23291f\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n<line x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"10.0\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"246.0\" stroke=\"#23291f\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n<circle cx=\"235.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"94.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#234539\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n<circle cx=\"329.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#6b7260\"/>\n<text x=\"345.0\" y=\"120.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">0</text>\n<circle cx=\"235.0\" cy=\"34.0\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#6b7260\"/>\n<text x=\"251.0\" y=\"28.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">π/2</text>\n<circle cx=\"141.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#6b7260\"/>\n<text x=\"127.0\" y=\"120.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">π</text>\n<circle cx=\"235.0\" cy=\"222.0\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#6b7260\"/>\n<text x=\"255.0\" y=\"238.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">3π/2</text>\n<line x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"292.9\" y2=\"53.9\" stroke=\"#234539\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"259.9\" y=\"85.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">1</text>\n<circle cx=\"292.9\" cy=\"53.9\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#234539\"/>\n<text x=\"300.9\" y=\"45.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#234539\">P</text>\n<line x1=\"292.9\" y1=\"53.9\" x2=\"292.9\" y2=\"128.0\" stroke=\"#6b7260\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n<line x1=\"292.9\" y1=\"53.9\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"53.9\" stroke=\"#6b7260\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n<line x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"292.9\" y2=\"128.0\" stroke=\"#c17f2b\" stroke-width=\"3.2\"/>\n<line x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"53.9\" stroke=\"#2f5d50\" stroke-width=\"3.2\"/>\n<text x=\"263.9\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#c17f2b\">cos α</text>\n<text x=\"227.0\" y=\"95.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2f5d50\">sin α</text>\n<path d=\"M261.0 128.0 A 26 26 0 0 0 251.0 107.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6b7260\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n<text x=\"269.0\" y=\"116.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#6b7260\">α</text>\n<text x=\"235.0\" y=\"262.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b7260\">het beeldpunt P heeft de cosinus als x en de sinus als y</text></svg>",
     "onderschrift": "Het beeldpunt van \\(\\alpha\\) heeft coördinaat \\((\\cos\\alpha,\\sin\\alpha)\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "De goniometrische cirkel heeft straal \\(1\\). Het <strong>beeldpunt</strong> van een hoek \\(\\alpha\\) heeft als coördinaat <strong>\\((\\cos\\alpha,\\sin\\alpha)\\)</strong>: de sinus is de hoogte van dat punt."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">kwadrant</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">hoeken</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">teken van \\(\\sin\\)</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">eerste</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(0\\) tot \\(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(+\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">tweede</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\) tot \\(\\pi\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(+\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">derde</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\pi\\) tot \\(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\), bv. \\(\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(-\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">vierde</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\) tot \\(2\\pi\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(-\\)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "\\(\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}=1\\), \\(\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{6}=\\frac{1}{2}\\), \\(\\sin\\pi=0\\). Hoeken die even hoog liggen, hebben dezelfde sinus: \\(\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{6}=\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\). Met je rekentoestel in radialen: \\(\\sin 2\\approx 0{,}91\\)."
    }
   ]
