  {
   "kop": "De algemene sinusfunctie",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<p style='text-align:center'><strong>\\(f(x)=a\\sin b(x-c)+d\\)</strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">betekenis</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">voorbeeld</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(a\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>amplitude</strong> \\(|a|\\): de helft van max \\(-\\) min; \\(a<0\\) spiegelt rond de \\(x\\)-as</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(3\\sin x+1\\): amplitude \\(3\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(b\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">periode \\(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{b}\\); horizontale uitrekking met factor \\(\\dfrac{1}{b}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\sin 4x\\): periode \\(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(c\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>faseverschuiving</strong>: \\(c\\) naar rechts</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(2\\sin\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\): \\(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\) naar rechts</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(d\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>evenwichtslijn</strong> \\(y=d\\); verandert de periode niet</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(3\\sin x+1\\): \\(y=1\\), bereik \\([-2,4]\\)</td></tr></table>"
